"全国握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブは「裸足でsummer」\n「僕だけの光」 も出ました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、「行くあてのない僕たち」\nフル初披露でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンは、まあやとペア！\n来てくださった方、有難うございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは、\n「らじらー！サンデー」でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとまりかと、一緒にお仕事できて\n楽しかった～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は気まぐれで、単独行動も多いけど\n何でも言い合える、信頼し合える仲間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出れたらいいなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリラジさん、聞いてくださった皆さん\n有難うございました！(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんの出演する舞台、\n「こちら葛飾区亀有公園前派出所」\n観てきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても笑い所満載で楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん、千秋楽までファイトッ\n応援してるね(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は和食中心なんだけど、\n久々に洋食が食べたくて作ってみたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ でーん ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ささみ生地のピザ\nまるごとさつまいものグラタン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一見コテコテに見えるけど、\nお肉や野菜でヘルシーに仕上げてます♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日だけ、実家に帰ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リーくん(﹡ˆˆ﹡)だいすき！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい家族、ねこまるくんにも会えたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月3日生まれの男の子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねこまるくんはとってもやんちゃで、\nリーくんのほうが先輩なのに臆病者なので\nいつも猫パンチくらってばかりいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまらなく可愛かった( ･ᴗ･̥̥̥ )\nもうずっと一緒に居たいよ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に会ったお母さんの天然も\n爆発してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母「わぁこの冷蔵庫おっきい！お母さん入れそう！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「お母さん、冷蔵庫には入れないよ(´･×･`)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母「あ、お母さん、この洗濯機にも入れそう！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでいちいち入ろうとすんのこの人..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り、車窓から虹が見えました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいことありそうだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステの くるりさん見ました\nめちゃめちゃかっこよかったです\n東京披露はずるいです。。\n心に響く曲だなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず季節に敏感でいたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/12/8197067/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-59665":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  \n  \n  \n  \n  切りました。\n  ボブより長く、ミディアムより短い\n  ロブです！\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFSB2BM0AQ0SJ6MYYSCX9YM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFSB3G9AHKF1WYVMGEAJ48F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFSB4KJ9YHGQ6D1FN1TRDZ8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFSB63BMEF5BS3EXTY5PC82","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFSB787XDY2GHQSM6KTP1P8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  短くてごめんなさい>_<\n  \n  \n  質問返し、次回します〜\n  なにかあればコメントしてください♪\n  \n  \n  \n  最近ハマってるドラマは\n  \"あなたが眠っている間に\"です\n  SUZYさんが好きなので見始めたのですが\n  話も面白いしきゅんきゅんするしで\n  ハマっています...☺︎\n  観た方いますか〜？\n  \n  \n  \n  では☺︎\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  "}],"source":"archive"}}